1.0.1 (2026-09-20)
------------------------------------------------------
* Changed the required Ace3 and LibSharedMedia libraries to be embedded in the addon instead of installed separately.
* Added a fallback to the bundled border, texture and font when the one selected in the options is no longer available.

------------------------------------------------------
1.0.0 (2026-09-19)
------------------------------------------------------
* A Feral Druid addon for Cat Form. It adds its own energy bar, combo points, timers for important debuffs, and icons for key procs and cooldowns, all positioned exactly where you want them. It stays out of the way outside Cat Form.
